      "description": "Shenzhou 12 is a Chinese spaceflight planned for launch on 17 June 2021. The flight will mark the seventh crewed Chinese spaceflight and the seventh crewed flight of the Shenzhou programme. The spacecraft is scheduled to carry three CNSA taikonauts on the first flight to Tianhe, the first module of the Tiangong space station."
